<p>Deploy a noisy lure that attracts all creatures within radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> to it for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 7, 9, 11, 13</acronym> turns.</p><p>It has <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">138, 172, 196, 214, 230</acronym> life (based on your Cunning) and is very durable, with <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 15, 18, 22, 25</acronym> armor and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">63%, 67%, 69%, 71%, 73%</acronym> resistance to non-physical damage.</p><p>At level 5, when the lure is destroyed, it will trigger some traps in a radius of 2 around it (check individual trap descriptions to see if they are triggered).</p><p>Use of this talent will not break stealth.</p>